      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-10T04:21:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that regardless of which platform we bias towards as being the \u0027default\u0027, there will be pros and cons, and it will be error prone whichever way.\nIt may be best to avoid having a default and have every platform define the pinctrl according to their own hardware configuration. Then there will be no chance of having this be error prone by using a wrong default.",
      "parentUuid": "26b36d75_315c6de1",
      "revId": "bd252b2503aa80fdb5af48b213adb41f52bcfc3a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
